{"event":{"data":{"artifact_rev":"d0500f7d410662d5823178244a3d871c2fa6bce1","commit_sha":"206c02613ae391ea073068ae0082152ab824190b","decisions":["Followed plan.md exactly: stdlib http.server only; HelloHandler serves GET /hello with 200, Content-Type text/plain, Content-Length 5, body 'hello'; any other path gets send_error(404).","make_server(host, port) is exposed so the test can bind to port 0 and run the server in a daemon thread.","Test-first: test_hello failed with ImportError before hello.py existed, then passed (1 test, OK).","Smoke-checked with curl: HTTP/1.0 200 OK, Content-Type text/plain, body 'hello'; /x returned 404. The project's local CI command is 'echo tests ok'."],"doubts":[],"lessons_proposed":["In this sandbox, curl to localhost goes through an HTTP proxy and returns a misleading 405. Use 'curl --noproxy \"*\"' for local smoke checks."],"run_id":"r-41-5","state":"implementing"},"epoch":1,"kind":"handoff_accepted","prev":"ce3d8453111eb856199d1e9832e2573022d6903766119f010b89290458a195e3","schema":1,"seq":26},"line":"event","schema":1,"seq":26}
